(text "G.O.S. sensor node rev 3.0\n\n18650 cell + USB-C charging, nRF52840 module (Thread / BLE), SHT40 and TSL2591 over I2C.\nLED drivers live on a separate board fed through J4. LoRa and GNSS are not fitted.\n\nSheets share nets through global labels and power symbols; the sheet symbols below carry no pins.\nPin map, power tree and datasheet sources: HARDWARE.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "22329c2d-da5e-5e34-a2ab-d6d021d0f87b"))
